cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these files, please cite them as below."
title: "Un avion suisse en modèle réduit : de la modélisation aux essais de vol du PC-7 MkII en passant par la simulation numérique et la conception – données, scripts et fichiers 3D"
abstract: >-
  OpenVSP model, automated VSPAERO simulations (18 wing configurations),
  simulation database, analysis notebooks, travail de maturité report and Fusion 360 / STEP CAD
  files of a 3D-printed, radio-controlled 1:10 Pilatus PC-7 MkII.
  Code under MIT; models, data, CAD files and report under CC BY 4.0
  (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
authors:
  - family-names: "Frésard"
    given-names: "Arthur"
    email: "arthurfresard@bluewin.ch"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24382179"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arloup/pc7-mk2-simtoolkit"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - aerodynamics
  - OpenVSP
  - VSPAERO
  - scale model
  - 3D printing
  - Pilatus PC-7
